"""Original bilingual briefs b391–b400; authored separately from the control generator.

Importing this module registers ten courses through the shared C helper.
All numerical exercises are explicitly hypothetical and require their model boundaries.
"""
from courses import C

C('b391','自動洗車的水質水量機械接觸與設備狀態交接~Water quality, mechanical clearance and state handoff in automatic train washing','machinery',r'''
water_use|噴洗水量與清水補充~Spray volume and freshwater makeup|先為預洗、刷洗和沖洗劃出水量邊界，追蹤回收水回到哪個環節。再比較相同洗淨需求下的補水量，保留車體帶出水與排泥的未建模損失。~Define water boundaries for prewash, brushing and rinsing, tracing where recycled water returns. Compare freshwater demand for the same cleaning task while retaining unmodelled carry-out and sludge losses.
dose|回收水配藥質量帳~Dosing mass balance for recycled water|將槽內已有溶質和本次追加質量分開，先確認濃度用質量每體積表示。再以混合取樣檢查均勻性，避免平均濃度合適卻有局部殘留。~Separate solute already in the tank from newly added mass and establish the concentration convention first. Sample mixing uniformity so a suitable mean cannot hide local residue.
fan_power|吹乾風道工作點~Drying-air duct operating point|吹乾效果取決於噴口分布與可達風量，不能只比較馬達額定功率。改變濾網阻力時同步記錄壓升和流量，找出能耗上升而乾燥未改善的原因。~Drying depends on outlet distribution and achieved flow rather than motor rating alone. Record pressure and flow while filter resistance changes to explain higher energy use without better drying.
heat|乾燥設備穩態熱路~Steady thermal paths in drying equipment|以平均發熱功率建立乾燥風機或驅動器的穩態溫度帳，不把此式當成升溫時間模型。比較清潔與堵塞散熱條件，觀察外殼和內部測點是否同向變化。~Build a steady temperature balance using mean dissipation, without treating it as a warm-up-time model. Compare clean and obstructed cooling paths and examine whether enclosure and internal temperatures change together.
hydraulic|洗刷臂液壓推進~Hydraulic positioning of washing arms|在假想洗刷臂上區分油缸推力與刷具接觸力，連桿和摩擦會改變兩者關係。用隔離教具比對壓力與行程，不能以壓力正常代替車體間隙確認。~Separate cylinder thrust from brush contact force in a hypothetical washing arm because linkage and friction change their relationship. Compare pressure and travel on an isolated rig rather than substituting pressure for vehicle-clearance verification.
actuator_sync|雙側洗刷臂同步~Synchronizing paired washing arms|兩側進給速度的微小差異會隨動作時間累積成位置差。以共同時基比較兩側行程，分辨感測偏移和真實偏斜，並保留異型車體的邊界情境。~A small difference in paired feed speeds accumulates into position mismatch. Compare travel on a common clock, distinguishing sensor offset from real skew and retaining cases involving different vehicle profiles.
latency_sum|車體偵測到設備退讓~From vehicle detection to equipment withdrawal|將車端辨識、控制處理與刷臂退讓各自的起訖時間寫清楚，避免漏算介面等待。以離線事件重播檢查先後次序，不把範例延遲當成現場保護設定。~Define start and finish events for vehicle-end detection, processing and arm withdrawal so handoff waiting is counted. Check ordering through offline replay without using the example delays as field protection settings.
battery|控制紀錄備援續航~Backup duration for control and logging|備援供電範圍限定為狀態監視與紀錄，不假設電池能維持全部洗車動力。將平均能量需求與啟動瞬間壓降分開，確認失電事件仍可被追溯。~Limit the backup boundary to monitoring and logging rather than assuming that it powers the entire washing plant. Separate average energy demand from startup voltage sag so supply-loss events remain traceable.
coverage|車型與中止情境矩陣~Vehicle-profile and interruption test matrix|把不同車頭外形、感測失效與洗程中止列成分開案例，不以多次同車試洗取代型式覆蓋。核對每案的設備狀態與復原證據，留下未驗證的條件。~List distinct cases for vehicle profiles, sensing failures and interrupted cycles rather than repeating one vehicle as a substitute for coverage. Check state and recovery evidence and retain untested conditions explicitly.
availability|洗車服務與維修配置~Washing service and maintenance allocation|區分可洗車、降級服務和完全停機，維修履歷才不會高估可用時間。再比較頻繁短停與罕見長停如何影響回廠列車排隊，保留相同可用度下的差異。~Distinguish full service, degraded washing and complete shutdown to avoid overstated availability. Compare how frequent brief stops and rare long outages affect returning-train queues despite equal long-run availability.
''')

C('b392','以能量與事件時序理解貨運駝峰調速~Energy accounting and event timing in hump-yard speed control','control',r'''
potential|坡高與重力能量帳~Height drop and gravitational energy|先畫出車輛質心高度的起訖位置，將可用位能與沿途阻力損失分開。比較不同質量的原創案例，避免只用坡高猜測到達速度。~Mark initial and final centre-of-mass heights and separate available potential energy from losses along the route. Compare hypothetical wagon masses without predicting arrival speed from height alone.
retarder|動能差與平均耗能力~Kinetic-energy change and mean retarding force|把入口與出口速度各自平方後建立能量差，觀察入口速度小幅偏差的放大效果。再把平均力與沿程峰值區分，不能從一個平均量推論接觸力分布。~Use squared entry and exit speeds to obtain the energy change and observe sensitivity to entry-speed error. Distinguish mean force from local peaks instead of inferring the contact distribution from one average.
pulse_speed|局部速度事件配對~Pairing events for local speed|兩測點必須對應同一輪對，否則除出來的速度可能形式正確卻沒有物理意義。以模型車往返重播檢查配對和方向，保留接近停車時的模糊情況。~Both detector events must correspond to the same wheelset or the computed speed has no physical meaning. Replay a model wagon in both directions and retain ambiguous near-standstill cases.
position_latency|速度資料年齡與位移~Data age and continued wagon movement|車輛在量測送往控制端的期間仍會移動，接收時刻不能重設量測年齡。將位移估算與原始定位界限並列，追蹤哪些誤差來自時序而非感測精度。~The wagon continues moving while a measurement reaches the controller, so reception cannot reset its age. Show age-related displacement beside the original position bound to distinguish timing effects from sensing precision.
odometry|輪周距離與地面行程~Wheel travel versus ground displacement|以獨立地標比較輪周累積距離，分離比例誤差和固定零點偏移。遇到滑移或不同輪徑時先質疑換算前提，不把平順數值當成真實位置證據。~Compare accumulated wheel travel with independent landmarks, separating scale error from zero offset. Question conversion assumptions under slip or changing wheel diameter rather than treating a smooth reading as ground truth.
braking|反應段與耗能段邊界~Response and deceleration boundaries|使用平直教學路段分開反應位移與定減速度位移，作為能量模型的交叉檢查。清楚標示此模型沒有坡道或變動調速力，不能替代真實駝峰控制曲線。~Separate response travel and constant-deceleration travel on a level teaching segment as an energy-model cross-check. State that gradients and variable retarding forces are absent, so this is not a real yard-control curve.
count_balance|區段軸數與未知狀態~Section axle balance and unknown state|區段進出軸數守恆只提供占用約束，不能告訴控制器車輛精確停在哪裡。將漏計、回滾和人工真值分開比較，零差值仍須具有可信的事件紀錄。~Boundary axle balance constrains occupancy but does not locate a wagon precisely. Compare missed counts, rollback and independent truth separately; a zero balance still requires trustworthy event records.
clock|調速事件共同時基~Common timebase for speed-control events|把入口偵測、控制回報與出口量測放到同一時間線，先排除各儀器時鐘差。再檢查長時間漂移，避免把紀錄錯序誤判為機構先後反應異常。~Place entry detection, controller reports and exit measurement on one timeline after accounting for clock offsets. Check longer-term drift before interpreting reordered records as a mechanical timing fault.
state_space|車組任務與路徑狀態~Wagon-group assignments and route states|分開車組辨識、路徑保留和設備可用狀態，避免一個正常旗標代表全部條件。用小型離線狀態圖找出互斥任務和循環等待，不重製現場控制邏輯。~Separate wagon identification, route reservation and equipment availability rather than treating one normal flag as universal readiness. Use a small offline state graph to detect incompatible assignments and circular waits without reproducing field logic.
coverage|載重與環境試驗邊界~Load and environment coverage|把假想載重、阻力與量測延遲獨立分層，避免所有試驗只集中在容易的組合。對未涵蓋的風、雨與車輛差異明列限制，保持推論範圍可追溯。~Stratify assumed load, resistance and measurement delay so tests do not concentrate on easy combinations. Record untested wind, rain and vehicle differences to keep inference within a traceable boundary.
''')

C('b393','貨櫃吊運載重分配擺動與場站節拍~Load distribution, sway and terminal throughput in intermodal lifting','machinery',r'''
container_lifting|總重量與吊點均分~Total load and mean lifting-point reaction|先將貨櫃與吊具質量放進同一載重邊界，再計算對稱教學模型的平均吊點反力。將這個平均量與最不利吊點分開，不能由總能力足夠推論每點都有餘裕。~Include container and spreader mass within one load boundary before calculating symmetric mean reactions. Keep that mean distinct from the worst support; adequate total capacity does not prove margin at every point.
eccentric|偏心貨載與支承反力~Eccentric cargo and support reactions|貨物偏向一側會改變兩支承反力，即使總重量完全相同。用已知偏心的縮尺載具核對力與力矩平衡，觀察幾何中心和重心並非同一點。~An off-centre load changes support reactions even when total weight is unchanged. Check force and moment balance on a scale load and distinguish geometric centre from centre of gravity.
hydraulic|吊具定位液壓鏈~Hydraulic positioning in the spreader|將定位油缸的推力與結構保持能力分開，壓力達到目標不代表鎖定已被證實。以隔離教具同時觀察行程與壓力，辨認背壓或摩擦造成的差異。~Separate positioning-cylinder thrust from structural holding capability; a pressure reading does not prove locking. Observe travel and pressure on an isolated rig to distinguish back-pressure and friction effects.
cycle|完整吊運循環率~Complete handling-cycle rate|將起吊、橫移、下降和對位全部計入單次作業，先建立串行節拍基準。再列出空返與等待所占時間，說明理想循環率為何高於實際場站吞吐。~Include hoisting, travel, lowering and alignment in a serial reference cycle. Then account for empty returns and waiting to explain why ideal machine cycles exceed achieved terminal throughput.
sway|吊索長度與殘餘擺動~Suspension length and residual sway|比較相同貨重在不同吊索長度下的擺動週期，將質量與週期的角色分清楚。設備橫移停止後仍要觀察殘餘角度，不能用速度歸零代表吊具已穩定。~Compare sway periods at different suspension lengths for the same cargo mass. Observe residual angle after travel stops because zero machine speed does not establish a stable suspended load.
utilization|吊機需求與服務負荷~Crane demand and service utilization|以每小時到達作業數和可服務作業數建立同一系統邊界，不能混用不同吊機群。再比較平均利用率與列車集中到達的尖峰，指出等待仍會在平均有餘裕時發生。~Use arrivals and service jobs per hour for the same crane group rather than mixing boundaries. Compare mean utilization with concentrated train arrivals to show why queues persist despite average spare capacity.
state_space|吊具車輛與作業區交接~Spreader, vehicle and work-zone handoff|把吊具位置、載具到位與作業區清空各自當成獨立狀態，不讓一項確認代替其他條件。以桌面狀態圖檢查矛盾組合，保留未知和中止而不自動猜測完成。~Represent spreader position, vehicle presence and work-zone clearance as separate states. Check conflicting combinations in a desktop graph and retain unknown or interrupted states instead of inferring completion.
availability|設備停機與貨櫃積壓~Equipment outages and container backlog|區分吊機故障時間、降級服務和修復等待，避免只統計更換零件的工時。比較同可用度下不同停機分布，評估貨櫃存量與轉乘班次受到的影響。~Distinguish crane failure, degraded service and repair waiting rather than counting only hands-on repair. Compare outage patterns at equal availability and examine container inventory and connection effects.
coverage|貨櫃型式與介面覆蓋~Container-type and interface coverage|建立不同尺寸、偏心情況與載具對位的案例矩陣，對每案保留量測與判定依據。重跑同一尺寸不能增加型式覆蓋，未測的吊具介面應明確列出。~Build a matrix of sizes, eccentricity and vehicle alignment with measurement and decision evidence for each case. Repeating one size does not cover additional types; list untested spreader interfaces explicitly.
test_time|場站整合試驗工時~Terminal integration-test effort|將設定環境、執行作業和恢復設備分開估算，避免只以最快吊運時間安排驗證。追蹤失敗案例的重測成本，使設備、車輛與人員時間可以一起核對。~Budget setup, execution and restoration separately rather than scheduling validation by the fastest lift. Track rerun costs after failures so equipment, vehicle and personnel time can be reconciled.
''')

C('b394','以溫度補償和獨立基準追蹤連續焊軌應變~Temperature compensation and independent references for continuous-welded-rail strain','cwr',r'''
thermal_stress|完全拘束的熱應力量級~Thermal stress under full restraint|先把鋼軌的無應力溫度與當前溫度分開，標明加熱時壓應力的方向。再比較完全拘束模型與可滑移現場的差異，避免把簡化量級當成挫屈判定。~Separate stress-free and current rail temperatures and identify compression during heating. Compare full restraint with possible field slip without treating this scale calculation as a buckling decision.
thermal_length|自由伸長對照試件~Free-expansion reference specimen|以同材質自由試件建立溫差對伸長的基準，再對照受拘束鋼軌的反應。端點位移很小可能意味拘束增加，不代表沒有熱作用。~Use an unrestrained specimen of the same material to establish expansion versus temperature before comparing restrained rail. Small end movement may indicate stronger restraint rather than absent thermal action.
strain_gauge|橋路輸出與機械應變~Bridge output and mechanical strain|在溫度補償後才把機械應變帶入四分之一橋的小訊號式，並保留激勵電壓紀錄。以分流校驗核對量測鏈，避免將放大器漂移當成鋼軌應力改變。~Insert mechanical strain into the small-signal quarter-bridge relation only after thermal compensation and retain excitation records. Use shunt calibration to distinguish measurement-chain drift from rail-stress change.
strain_rss|隨機量測不確定度~Random measurement uncertainty|先辨認哪些誤差具有獨立重複量測依據，再合成標準差。固定溫度偏差與共同基準偏移另列，不能藉平方和開根號把它們縮小。~Identify errors supported by independent repeat measurements before combining standard deviations. Keep fixed temperature bias and shared-reference offsets separate rather than reducing them through root-sum-square arithmetic.
survey_angle|感測位置與測量基準~Sensor positions and survey datums|應變事件需要能回到同一鋼軌位置，長視線的角度誤差會放大定位差。以不同站點閉合核對位置，避免重複讀值一致卻共同使用偏移的基準。~Strain events must map back to the same rail location, and angular error grows with sight distance. Check positions from independent stations so repeatability cannot hide a displaced shared datum.
sampling|移動檢測的空間取樣~Spatial sampling during mobile inspection|將移動檢測車的速度與取樣率換成空間間距，另行說明固定式應變計不使用這個移動假設。比較不同車速下的特徵保留，避免把取樣間距直接宣稱為缺陷解析度。~Convert inspection-vehicle speed and sampling rate into spacing while distinguishing fixed gauges from this moving assumption. Compare feature retention across speeds without equating sample spacing with defect resolution.
clock|溫度與應變時間對齊~Aligning temperature and strain records|軌溫與應變若不同步，日照快速改變時可能形成假的相位或遲滯。用共同時間基準核對漂移，再判斷曲線差異是否來自真實材料與拘束反應。~Unsynchronized temperature and strain can create false phase shifts during rapid solar heating. Check clock drift before attributing curve differences to material or restraint behaviour.
coverage|季節與拘束狀態案例~Seasonal and restraint-state cases|把溫度範圍、支承狀態與感測黏貼品質分開列成案例，避免只在穩定天氣驗證。每個結論都要連回已測條件，未涵蓋的滑移或局部加熱需保留限制。~Separate temperature range, support condition and sensor bonding in the test matrix rather than validating only steady weather. Tie conclusions to tested conditions and retain limits for untested slip or local heating.
confidence_zero|零異常資料的推論界限~Limits of anomaly-free data|連續紀錄多筆資料常具有時間相關性，不能直接當成相同數量的獨立試驗。先定義獨立採樣單位，再解讀零異常的上界，不由此宣告鋼軌絕對安全。~Consecutive samples are often correlated and cannot automatically count as independent trials. Define independent sampling units before interpreting an anomaly-free bound, without declaring unconditional rail safety.
test_time|監測校驗與追溯計畫~Calibration effort and traceability|校驗工時要包含參考溫度穩定、橋路檢查與資料同步確認，不能只計讀取數值時間。建立更換感測器後的重驗項目，讓跨季節比較保有相同基準。~Include temperature stabilization, bridge checks and synchronization in calibration effort rather than only reading time. Define rechecks after sensor replacement so seasonal comparisons retain a consistent reference.
''')

C('b395','槽型鋼軌輪緣界面排水與街道交通協調~Grooved-rail flange interfaces, drainage and street-traffic coordination','crossing',r'''
groove_tolerance|輪緣槽幾何誤差預算~Flangeway geometry uncertainty budget|將槽型製造、輪緣幾何與測量界限分開相加，所得只是誤差預算而非實際槽寬。用斷面圖標明接觸和非接觸位置，避免把範例數值誤作驗收限值。~Sum manufacturing, flange-geometry and survey bounds as an uncertainty budget rather than an actual groove width. Mark contact and clearance locations on a section sketch without converting example values into acceptance limits.
runoff|街道集水與排水需求~Street runoff and drainage demand|先劃定會流向軌槽的集水面積，將雨強、面積與逕流係數放到一致單位。計算結果只是來水需求，仍需另查坡度、堵塞和排水出口能力。~Delineate the area draining toward the rail and use consistent rainfall, area and runoff units. The result is inflow demand; slopes, blockage and outlet capacity need separate assessment.
survey_angle|路面與鋼軌測量基準~Street and rail survey reference|把路面標高、軌頂與街道交叉坡放在同一測量基準，避免各專業各自看似合格。比較不同視距的定位誤差，檢查施工移交時是否保留一致控制點。~Reference pavement level, rail head and crossfall to one survey datum rather than accepting disconnected discipline checks. Compare sight-distance errors and verify continuity of control points at construction handoff.
thermal_length|鋼軌與鋪面自由變形~Free movement of rail and pavement|先算鋼軌自由熱伸長，再討論周邊鋪面和固定條件如何限制這個位移。接縫看不出移動仍可能累積內力，量測需同時保留溫度與邊界狀態。~Calculate free rail expansion before discussing restraint from pavement and fixings. Little visible joint movement may coexist with internal force, so retain temperature and boundary-condition records together.
centripetal|街道曲線的側向加速度~Lateral acceleration on street curves|以車速平方和曲線半徑比較側向加速度量級，不把結果當成輪緣力或脫軌判定。再辨認超高、車體姿態和輪軌接觸是這個簡式未處理的部分。~Compare lateral-acceleration scale using speed squared and curve radius without equating it to flange force or derailment assessment. Identify cant, body attitude and contact behaviour as omitted mechanisms.
wear|軌槽輪廓磨耗趨勢~Groove-profile wear trends|固定同一斷面與量測方向比較磨耗深度，先排除測點變動造成的假趨勢。短期線性率只用於相同工況的近程比較，路口污染和潤滑改變後需重新檢查。~Compare wear at a fixed section and direction to exclude false trends from changed measurement positions. Use linear rates only for short similar-condition comparisons and reassess after contamination or lubrication changes.
braking|路面混行的停止距離~Stopping distance in shared streets|將反應距離與制動距離分開，觀察速度增加時第二項的平方效應。濕滑路面和軌面黏著另作情境限制，不把平直定減速度模型直接用於街道配置。~Separate reaction and braking travel to observe the square-speed contribution. Treat wet pavement and rail adhesion as separate scenario limits rather than designing a street from a level constant-deceleration model.
reaction_distance|路口提示與察覺距離~Junction warnings and reaction travel|把看見提示、理解意義和開始動作列成不同事件，避免只量按鍵反應。以不同假想行進速度換算這段時間消耗的距離，保留道路使用者能力差異。~Separate seeing, understanding and acting instead of measuring only a button response. Convert that interval into travel at hypothetical speeds while retaining differences between road users.
vehicle_clearance|混行路口車尾清空~Rear clearance at shared intersections|清空距離必須追蹤車尾離開衝突區，不是車頭通過停止線便完成。以離線時空圖核對低速長車與等待因素，避免將教學秒數當成號誌時制。~Track the rear leaving the conflict area rather than only the front crossing a line. Use an offline time-distance chart for slow long vehicles and waiting without adopting teaching seconds as signal timings.
coverage|街道介面交付案例~Street-interface acceptance cases|把軌槽幾何、排水、行人穿越與道路資訊分成可追溯的測試需求，避免只驗證列車能通過。對跨單位交接保留版本和條件，清楚列出尚未涵蓋的街道情境。~Trace groove geometry, drainage, pedestrian crossing and road information to separate test requirements rather than checking only train passage. Retain handoff versions, conditions and street scenarios still untested.
''')

C('b396','區分分段地面供電與車載儲能的無架空線系統~Distinguishing segmented ground supply from onboard energy storage','aps',r'''
traction|輪周功率與電源需求~Wheel power and supply demand|先以車輛加速和阻力建立輪周機械功率，再另列供電轉換與輔機損失。比較同速度下不同載重需求，不把車載電流直接等同於有效牽引力。~Establish wheel mechanical power from acceleration and resistance before accounting for conversion and auxiliary losses. Compare loads at the same speed without treating supply current as effective tractive effort.
energy|回生能量與接收邊界~Regeneration and receiving boundaries|把列車動能上限、轉換效率和接收能力分開，辨認能量究竟回到電網還是車載儲能。接收端不可用時不能假設全部回收，能量帳仍要列出耗散去向。~Separate kinetic-energy limit, conversion efficiency and receptivity, identifying grid and onboard storage as different receivers. When reception is unavailable, retain the dissipation path instead of assuming complete recovery.
feeder_loss|導體接觸的電阻損失~Resistive losses in conductors and contacts|在理想直流回路中以電流平方比較電阻損失，區分有用牽引功率與局部發熱。接觸劣化會改變電阻與熱點位置，量測需同時保留電流和壓降。~Use current squared to compare resistive loss in an ideal DC path, separating useful traction power from local heating. Retain current and voltage-drop measurements as contact deterioration changes resistance and hotspot location.
battery|輔助供電的跨區續航~Auxiliary backup across supply gaps|此單元只估控制和監視負載的定電壓備援時間，不代表車輛主牽引續航。先列可用能量比例，再討論負載尖峰與老化如何讓平均能量估算失準。~Estimate constant-voltage backup for controls and monitoring only, not main traction range. State usable-energy fraction before discussing surges and ageing that can defeat an average-energy estimate.
heat|車載轉換器散熱邊界~Cooling boundaries of onboard converters|以平均損失功率估算轉換器穩態熱點，將環境溫度和散熱路徑分開改變。相同負載下的溫升差異可提示熱阻變化，但此模型不預測每次通過區段的瞬態峰值。~Estimate steady converter temperature from mean loss and vary ambient and heat paths separately. Temperature differences can reveal thermal-resistance changes, but the model does not predict each segment-transition transient.
state_space|供電區段與車載模式~Supply-section and onboard states|區分地面分段供電、架空線與車載儲能三種功能邊界，不把所有無架空線技術視為同一機制。用抽象狀態圖檢查模式資訊一致性，範例不重製廠商通電邏輯。~Distinguish ground segments, overhead supply and onboard storage instead of treating all catenary-free systems as one mechanism. Check mode consistency in an abstract graph without reproducing supplier energization logic.
latency_sum|電源模式交接時序~Power-mode handoff timing|把來源辨識、介面處理和狀態確認分成可測事件，追蹤訊息何時真正被採用。總延遲只是教學預算，不能取代電氣保護與能量緩衝的獨立驗證。~Split source identification, interface processing and confirmation into observable events and trace when information is used. The teaching timing budget does not replace independent protection or energy-buffer verification.
redundancy|備援電源共同原因~Common causes in backup supplies|即使來源有兩種，轉換器、控制電源或冷卻路徑仍可能共用。先列共享介面再分析獨立失效，避免將設備數量增加誤認為風險自動歸零。~Two sources may still share converters, control power or cooling paths. Identify shared interfaces before analysing independent failures rather than assuming additional equipment eliminates risk.
coverage|潮濕污損與模式案例~Wet, contaminated and mode-transition cases|把環境狀態與供電模式分成測試軸，不以乾燥正常運轉代表全部使用範圍。追溯每項需求的證據與未測邊界，數值算例不作為實際通電允許條件。~Treat environmental condition and power mode as separate test axes rather than generalizing from dry normal operation. Trace requirement evidence and untested boundaries without using example values as energization permissions.
availability|線路服務與設備修復~Line service and equipment recovery|分開電源局部退出、車輛降級與全線停駛，才能解釋同樣故障對服務的不同影響。核對修復與恢復服務的時間點，避免可用度漂亮卻遮蔽功能受限。~Distinguish local supply withdrawal, degraded vehicles and line suspension to explain different service consequences. Audit repair and service-restoration times so attractive availability cannot conceal reduced functionality.
''')

C('b397','跨座導梁的彎扭變形幾何與車輛動態介面~Bending, torsion, geometry and vehicle dynamics of straddle-monorail beams','monorail',r'''
beam_deflection|導梁彎曲的量級檢查~Scale check of guideway bending|以簡支跨中力建立導梁撓度基準，觀察跨度三次方對變形的影響。真實輪載分布和支承條件另列，避免將單一教學梁當成整條導梁驗收。~Use a simply supported central-load beam as a deflection reference and examine cubic span sensitivity. Retain real wheel distribution and supports as separate conditions rather than accepting a full guideway through one beam model.
torsion|偏心輪載與導梁扭轉~Eccentric wheel loads and beam twist|跨座車輛偏心載重會使導梁兩側產生相對轉角，即使中心線撓度仍小。以成對高程量測檢查扭轉，區分剛體轉動、支承沉陷與截面變形。~Eccentric monorail loading can twist opposite guide surfaces despite small centreline deflection. Use paired elevation measurements to distinguish twist, rigid rotation and support settlement.
centripetal|曲線速度與側向需求~Curve speed and lateral demand|將曲線半徑和車速換成側向加速度量級，觀察車速平方的影響。導向輪力仍取決於車體和懸吊分配，不可把集中質點結果直接當成單輪荷載。~Convert curve radius and speed into a lateral-acceleration scale and examine the square-speed effect. Guide-wheel forces still depend on vehicle and suspension distribution, so a point-mass result is not a single-wheel load.
thermal_length|導梁伸縮與支承活動~Thermal movement and support travel|先用自由伸長估計均勻溫差下的位移需求，再比較固定與活動支承如何改變反應。日照熱梯度和支承卡滯不在此簡式內，須另保留量測證據。~Estimate uniform-temperature free movement before comparing fixed and sliding support responses. Solar gradients and seized bearings lie outside the simple relation and need separate measurement evidence.
survey_angle|導向面幾何控制網~Survey control for guide surfaces|車輛接觸的導向面必須與控制網建立可重複的幾何關係，長視線會放大角度誤差。以閉合觀測檢查基準一致性，不用單站重複性代替全線準確度。~Tie contact guide surfaces reproducibly to the control network because angular error grows with sight distance. Use closure checks rather than substituting repeated readings at one station for network accuracy.
rss|幾何量測隨機成分~Random components of geometry measurement|將獨立儀器讀值的標準差與共同基準偏差分開，再決定能否平方和合成。若左右導向面共用同一基準，必須保留相關性而非盲目縮小誤差。~Separate independent-reading standard deviations from common datum bias before root-sum-square combination. Retain correlations when both guide surfaces share a reference rather than automatically shrinking the uncertainty.
spatial_frequency|導梁波長與行車激振~Guideway wavelength and running excitation|相同幾何波長在不同車速下形成不同時間頻率，因此只看最大偏差會漏掉動態資訊。將量測波長與車速並列，找出需要車輛模型進一步分析的組合。~The same geometric wavelength produces different temporal frequencies at different speeds, so peak deviation alone misses dynamic information. Pair wavelength with speed to identify combinations needing a vehicle-response model.
resonance|剛度質量與模態概念~Stiffness, mass and modal interpretation|先用單自由度模型理解剛度和質量如何改變固有頻率，再比較來自導梁幾何的激振。模型沒有阻尼與多模態，不能只憑頻率相近就估計真實放大量。~Use one degree of freedom to understand stiffness and mass effects before comparing guideway excitation. With damping and multiple modes absent, frequency proximity alone cannot determine actual amplification.
gap_budget|導梁車輛與月台界面~Guideway, vehicle and platform interface|將導梁位置、懸吊移動和月台測量放到同一間隙預算，避免土建與車輛各自合格卻介面衝突。明確區分有界容差與隨機標準差，不能互換合成方法。~Combine guideway position, suspension movement and platform survey in one gap budget to expose interface conflicts between separately acceptable disciplines. Distinguish bounded tolerances from random standard deviations when combining them.
coverage|彎扭溫度整合案例~Combined bending, torsion and temperature cases|把載重位置、溫度條件與支承狀態分成可追溯案例，確認檢測不只涵蓋正中靜載。保留各模型未處理的耦合項，交付時指出仍需更完整分析的邊界。~Trace load location, temperature and support state through cases that extend beyond centred static loading. Retain omitted coupling mechanisms and identify boundaries requiring fuller analysis at handover.
''')

C('b398','懸掛轉轍的承載路徑機構定位與鎖定證據~Load paths, positioning and locking evidence in suspended-monorail switches','suspended',r'''
switch_work|可動構件力行程帳~Force-travel work of moving members|用假想轉轍構件的力與位移建立準靜態作功，不假定其機構等同一般尖軌。比較往返曲線的差異，找出摩擦或對位偏差可能出現的行程位置。~Build quasistatic work from a hypothetical moving member without equating it to a conventional switch blade. Compare forward and reverse curves to locate possible friction or alignment effects.
switch_torque|轉轍連桿力臂與轉矩~Switch-linkage lever arm and torque|轉轍構件的力臂必須垂直於作用力，不能把連桿全長直接代入。比較不同幾何位置的機械利益，明確保留簡化定力臂未描述的死點行為。~Use the perpendicular lever arm rather than the entire linkage length. Compare mechanical advantage across positions and retain dead-centre behaviour omitted by a constant-arm approximation.
actuator_sync|多致動點位置差~Position mismatch across actuators|同一可動梁的多個致動點若不同步，微小速度差可能累積成扭斜。以共同時基追蹤位置差和負載轉移，不把平均行程完成當成各點同時到位。~Small speed differences among actuators on one moving beam can accumulate into skew. Track position differences and load transfer on a common clock rather than treating mean completed travel as simultaneous arrival.
hydraulic|致動推力與獨立保持~Actuation thrust and independent holding|液壓壓力乘有效面積只估算推力，不能單獨證明載車路徑已能承載。將定位、保持和位置確認分開列成介面，使用隔離教具觀察摩擦與背壓。~Pressure times effective area estimates thrust but does not establish a load-bearing train path. Separate positioning, holding and confirmation interfaces and inspect friction and back pressure on an isolated rig.
eccentric|承載位置與支點反力~Load position and support reactions|在兩支承教學模型中移動偏心載重，觀察反力如何重新分配而總和不變。將可動構件自重和假想車重分列，避免以幾何中心代替實際重心。~Move an eccentric load in a two-support teaching model and observe reaction redistribution at constant total load. Separate moving-member weight from hypothetical vehicle weight and distinguish geometric centre from centre of gravity.
state_space|位置鎖定與路徑狀態~Position, locking and route states|到位、鎖定與路徑允許是不同命題，任何單一訊號都不能自動代表整個介面完成。以抽象狀態圖保存未知與不一致情況，不照抄代表工程的專有控制邏輯。~Position reached, locking established and route permission are different propositions. Preserve unknown and inconsistent combinations in an abstract graph without reproducing a reference installation's proprietary logic.
latency_sum|動作回授的事件次序~Event ordering in actuator feedback|把動作命令、機械反應和位置回授分成獨立時間點，檢查軟體顯示是否早於實體確認。將感測更新和傳輸等待列帳，範例不作現場動作延時設定。~Separate command, mechanical response and position feedback to check whether a display precedes physical confirmation. Account for sensor updates and transmission waiting without adopting example delays as field settings.
redundancy|雙確認鏈共同原因~Common causes in duplicated confirmation|兩個位置通道若共用安裝支架或電源，仍可能同時產生相同錯誤。先列共享條件再比較獨立失效，讓備援論證保留機械與電氣的共同來源。~Position channels sharing a bracket or supply may produce the same error simultaneously. Identify common mechanical and electrical conditions before combining independent failures in a redundancy argument.
coverage|中止偏斜與失訊案例~Interrupted, skewed and missing-feedback cases|把正常切換、行程中止和確認失聯分成不同試驗，不以多次成功動作代表全部狀態。用離線重播追蹤每項需求，保留安全停止後的復原邊界。~Treat normal switching, interrupted travel and lost confirmation as distinct tests rather than counting repeated successful moves as full coverage. Trace requirements through offline replay and retain recovery boundaries after safe withdrawal.
availability|維修恢復與服務條件~Maintenance recovery and service conditions|區分機構修復、確認鏈恢復和旅客服務恢復，三者時間點不必相同。以維修履歷比較短停與長停，避免可用度數字掩蓋仍未完成的承載或鎖定證據。~Distinguish mechanism repair, confirmation recovery and passenger-service restoration because their timestamps may differ. Compare short and long outages without letting availability conceal incomplete load-path or locking evidence.
''')

C('b399','以空間頻譜與測量不確定度控制磁浮導梁精度~Maglev guideway precision through spatial spectra and survey uncertainty','maglev',r'''
survey_angle|導向道測量角度誤差~Angular error in guideway surveying|先由視距與微小角度誤差估算橫向偏移，辨認長視線對控制網的影響。再用獨立站點和閉合差交叉檢查，避免共同基準錯誤被重複性掩蓋。~Estimate transverse offset from sight distance and small angular error to examine network sensitivity. Cross-check independent stations and closure so repeatability cannot hide a shared datum fault.
rss|精度帳的獨立與相關成分~Independent and correlated precision terms|把儀器重複誤差、目標安裝和基準偏移逐項分類，只有符合獨立假設者才合成標準差。共同偏移仍須另列，不能用漂亮的總數代替誤差來源說明。~Classify repeat-reading error, target installation and datum offsets before combining independent standard deviations. Keep common shifts explicit instead of replacing the error story with an attractive total.
thermal_length|導梁溫差與基準時刻~Guideway temperature and reference epoch|不同時間量測的導梁可能因溫度而改變長度，先定義比較所用的參考狀態。自由均勻伸長只是基準模型，熱梯度和拘束須另外追蹤。~Measurements at different times may capture thermal length changes, so define the comparison reference state first. Uniform free expansion is only a baseline; gradients and restraint require separate tracking.
spatial_frequency|不平順波長轉換~Converting irregularity wavelengths|保留導向道不平順的波長，而不只報最大高低差，才能連到行車激振頻率。比較不同假想車速的頻率變化，明確區分幾何輸入和車體實際反應。~Retain irregularity wavelength rather than only maximum deviation to relate geometry to excitation frequency. Compare hypothetical speeds while distinguishing geometric input from actual vehicle response.
resonance|懸浮系統頻率量級~Frequency scale of a suspension model|用線性單自由度彈簧質量模型理解固有頻率，並清楚標示它沒有完整磁路與控制器。再比較幾何激振的頻率位置，不由無阻尼模型推論真實乘坐加速度。~Use a linear spring-mass model to understand frequency scale while explicitly excluding full magnetic and controller dynamics. Compare excitation locations without inferring actual ride acceleration from an undamped model.
sampling|幾何檢測速度與取樣~Inspection speed and geometric sampling|固定取樣頻率在較高檢測速度下會拉大空間間距，可能漏過短波長特徵。核對時間戳與抗混疊前提，不把資料點變多直接當成幾何證據變強。~Fixed-rate sampling spreads observations farther apart at higher inspection speed and may miss short wavelengths. Check timestamps and anti-alias assumptions rather than treating extra data rows as stronger geometry evidence.
magnetic_pressure|理想吸力模型的適用邊界~Limits of an ideal magnetic-attraction model|只用理想均勻氣隙的靜態磁壓說明磁通平方的尺度關係，不把它冒充超導電動懸浮。再指出導梁間隙誤差會透過不同磁路機制影響力，需依實際系統另建模型。~Use ideal uniform-gap static pressure only to illustrate square-flux scaling, not superconducting electrodynamic suspension. Explain that gap errors affect force through system-specific magnetic mechanisms requiring separate models.
clock|幾何與車體量測時間鏈~Timing of geometry and vehicle measurements|比較導梁位置資料和車體加速度時，先確認兩者使用同一時間基準。校時偏移會把反應配到錯誤位置，因此需在推論幾何原因前核對事件對齊。~Confirm a common timebase before comparing guideway position data with vehicle acceleration. Clock offsets can associate a response with the wrong location, so alignment precedes geometric causal claims.
coverage|測量施工與運行邊界~Survey, construction and running cases|把梁段製作、安裝定位和運行量測分成不同證據層，不能以其中一層合格替代全部。建立速度、溫度與支承條件的案例矩陣，保留未驗證的動態耦合。~Separate fabrication, erection and running evidence rather than allowing one successful layer to stand for all. Build speed, temperature and support cases while retaining unverified dynamic coupling.
confidence_zero|有限合格紀錄的外推~Extrapolating finite successful records|連續相鄰測點往往相關，全部合格不能直接當成大量獨立零失效試驗。先定義抽樣母體與獨立單位，再解讀上界並限制對未測梁段的外推。~Adjacent measurements are often correlated and cannot become many independent failure-free trials merely by passing. Define the population and independent units before interpreting a bound or extrapolating to unmeasured sections.
''')

C('b400','以需求追溯和交叉量測整合鐵路試驗證據~Rail integration evidence through requirements traceability and cross-measurement','control',r'''
coverage|需求介面與試驗追溯~Requirements, interfaces and test traceability|先把土建、車輛、供電與列控需求連到對應試驗，不只計算完成案例總數。將未測、失敗和不適用分開，使百分比背後仍看得見每項交付責任。~Trace civil, rolling-stock, power and control requirements to tests rather than counting completed cases alone. Separate untested, failed and inapplicable items so percentages retain individual handover responsibilities.
test_time|整合試驗工時與恢復~Integration-test effort and restoration|每案除了執行還需要環境還原、資料核對和異常重測，應在安排時一起列帳。比較不同版本組合的工作量，避免省略恢復時間而形成無法重現的證據。~Budget environment restoration, data checks and anomaly reruns alongside execution. Compare effort across configuration combinations rather than omitting recovery time and producing evidence that cannot be reproduced.
latency_sum|跨系統事件時間預算~Cross-system event timing budget|沿同一事件追蹤感測、傳輸、計算與致動，核對各供應商定義的起訖是否一致。不要將不同情境下的平均值直接拼接成最壞反應證明。~Trace sensing, transmission, computation and actuation for the same event and reconcile supplier start/finish definitions. Do not assemble means from different scenarios into an asserted worst-case response.
clock|多設備紀錄的因果排序~Causal ordering across equipment logs|建立獨立時間基準後才比較車載、地面和儀器紀錄，保留校時與重啟事件。若時間偏移未被控制，先後順序本身不足以證明哪個系統造成延遲。~Compare onboard, wayside and instrument records only after establishing an independent time reference, retaining resynchronization and restart events. Uncontrolled offsets prevent apparent ordering from identifying the cause of delay.
headway|運能試驗的資源邊界~Resource boundaries in capacity trials|把區間、月台與折返各自的占用列在時空圖，觀察瓶頸是否隨情境改變。單一區間通過試驗不等於全線能達同樣班距，仍需整合旅客服務條件。~Plot section, platform and reversal occupation separately to observe shifting bottlenecks. Passing an isolated-section trial does not establish the same whole-line headway without passenger-service conditions.
braking|停止試驗的分段核對~Segment-by-segment stopping checks|將反應與減速階段分開積分，以位移量測交叉核對速度和加速度紀錄。簡化模型只能幫助辨認誤差來源，不代替載重、坡度與黏著條件的正式證據。~Integrate response and deceleration separately and cross-check speed and acceleration against displacement. The simplified model helps diagnose discrepancies but does not replace evidence over load, gradient and adhesion conditions.
state_space|整合模式與未知狀態~Integrated modes and unknown states|分別列出各子系統模式，檢查相同名稱是否具有相同資料有效性與轉移條件。保留故障、恢復和未完成交接，避免只展示正常運轉的少數畫面。~List subsystem modes separately and check whether matching names share validity and transition conditions. Retain faults, recovery and incomplete handoffs instead of demonstrating only a few normal-operation screens.
fault_union|整合失效的原因邏輯~Cause logic for integrated failures|先畫清楚任一失效或同時失效才會形成的頂事件，再選擇聯集或交集。不同任務時間的機率不能混算，跨系統共同原因也不能假設獨立。~Define whether either failure or simultaneous failures create the top event before choosing union or intersection. Keep mission intervals consistent and do not assume independence of shared cross-system causes.
availability|試運轉服務與缺陷修復~Trial service and defect recovery|將缺陷發現、功能降級、修復完成與服務恢復分成不同時間戳，讓維修影響可被比較。高可用度只描述服務比例，仍需分開處理安全性與未關閉缺陷。~Separate defect discovery, degradation, repair completion and service restoration timestamps to compare maintenance effects. High availability describes service fraction while safety and unresolved defects remain separate matters.
confidence_zero|試運轉零失敗的證據界限~Evidence limits of failure-free trials|先核對試運轉情境是否獨立且代表預定使用範圍，再計算零失敗的單側上界。重複容易案例不能證明所有條件安全，交付結論必須附上抽樣和模型限制。~Check independence and representation of intended use before calculating a one-sided bound from failure-free trials. Repeated easy cases cannot establish safety across all conditions; handover conclusions retain sampling and model limits.
''')
